{"author": "edwong57", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to merge  \n\nGO:0000032 cell wall mannoprotein biosynthetic process\nGO:0031506 cell wall glycoprotein biosynthetic process\n\n into  GO:0009101 glycoprotein biosynthetic process\n\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/32671\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1-VKM1g0A7LL5fLC46G85OtveqYswuZwyKem21cuh3FA/edit?usp=sharing\n\nImpacted groups: \n\nCGD | 9\n~PomBase | 1~ DONE\nSGD | 10 (will be automatically changed)\nUniProt | 2 will be automatically changed)\nTAIR | 1\n\n\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \n[LIST IDs + ADD ASSIGNEES] \n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-09-28T19:00:35Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0000032 cell wall mannoprotein biosynthetic process GO:0031506 cell wall glycoprotein biosynthetic process", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-10-28T10:53:44Z"}
